{
  "version": 8,
  "metadata": {
    "test": {
      "height": 256,
      "width": 256,
      "allowed": 0.01,
      "description": "Color-relief drawn above a vector fill. The layer order sandwiches the fill between two relief pairs - bathymetry color-relief, bathymetry hillshade, land fill, terrain color-relief, terrain hillshade - so the upper color-relief has to composite over vector geometry rather than straight onto the background."
    }
  },
  "center": [
    0,
    45
  ],
  "zoom": 1,
  "sources": {
